flowchart TD
    %% crystalline install, per harness
    install([crystalline install]) --> detect[Detect harnesses]
    detect --> each{For each harness}
    each --> mcp[Register the MCP server with --harness]
    each --> hooks[Write the session hooks]
    each --> skills[Place the skills]
    mcp & hooks & skills --> receipt[(Install receipt)]
    receipt --> gate[Per-harness gating at process start]
